      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat: add bridge rich links",
        "body": "## Summary\n- add `send-rich --url <url> --rich-link` for bridge-backed URL preview balloon sends\n- forward RPC `send.rich` params `url` + `rich_link: true` into the bridge\n- build URL preview payloads as `RichLink`-rooted archives containing fetched `LPLinkMetadata`, hidden preview-image transfer metadata, and rich-link body/data-detector attributes matching Messages.app compose behavior\n- link the injected helper against LinkPresentation in all helper build/sign paths\n- fix queued CLI/RPC identity resolution so URL-only rich-link sends resolve using the effective URL text\n- keep release-owned changelog changes out of the branch\n\n## Redacted runtime proof on lobster\nProof collected on lobster with branch-local artifacts from `feat/rich-links` and a freshly relaunched SIP-disabled injected Messages.app session. Raw logs stay local because they include chat GUIDs, message GUIDs, row IDs, and local identifiers.\n\n- branch head: `885e5a4`\n- working proof directory: `/Users/lobster/imsg-pr-proofs/2026-07-08/165-rich-links/working-20260708-234615`\n- earlier exploratory proof directories remain under `/Users/lobster/imsg-pr-proofs/2026-07-08/165-rich-links/`\n- test chat: `Lobster Test Group` (chat row 22; GUID redacted in PR text)\n- before-fix bridge rows: URL preview rows had no usable hidden preview transfer and rendered as load-preview placeholders / did not appear correctly recipient-side\n- manual Messages.app compose comparison row: native URL preview row persisted `balloon_bundle_id=com.apple.messages.URLBalloonProvider`, `message_summary_info={enc:true,eogcd:3,ust:true}`, hidden outgoing `.pluginPayloadAttachment`, `cache_has_attachments=1`, and `has_dd_results=1`\n- branch working row: row 6774 for `https://lobster.shahine.com/` persisted `balloon_bundle_id=com.apple.messages.URLBalloonProvider`, `payload_data` length 2155, `message_summary_info` length 72, `cache_has_attachments=1`, `has_dd_results=1`, and attributed body length 1150\n- branch hidden preview transfer: attachment row 310 had `.pluginPayloadAttachment`, `total_bytes=107835`, `is_outgoing=1`, `hide_attachment=1`, `transfer_state=5`, `preview_generation_state=3`\n- branch payload archive contained `RichLink`, `LPLinkMetadata`, `RichLinkImageAttachmentSubstitute`, `contentImages`, `contentImagesMetadata`, `icons`, `images`, `LPImageMetadata`, and `LPIconMetadata`\n- visual confirmation from user: the recipient-side Messages UI showed the generated rich card rendering with title/domain/image after tapping through the preview placeholder\n\nWorking row comparison excerpt:\n```\nmanual row 6752: URLBalloonProvider payload_len=1980 summary_len=72 cache_has_attachments=1 has_dd_results=1 attr_len=1011\nbranch row 6774: URLBalloonProvider payload_len=2155 summary_len=72 cache_has_attachments=1 has_dd_results=1 attr_len=1150\n```\n\nHidden preview attachment comparison excerpt:\n```\nmanual row 6752: .pluginPayloadAttachment total_bytes=107835 is_outgoing=1 hide_attachment=1 transfer_state=5 preview_generation_state=3\nbranch row 6774: .pluginPayloadAttachment total_bytes=107835 is_outgoing=1 hide_attachment=1 transfer_state=5 preview_generation_state=3\n```\n\n## Verification\n- `make build` ✅ on lobster for `885e5a4`\n- `swift format lint --recursive Sources Tests TestsLinux` ✅\n- `git diff --check` ✅\n- `make lint` ⚠️ blocked after swift-format by local SwiftLint/SourceKit crash: `Loading sourcekitdInProc.framework/Versions/A/sourcekitdInProc failed`\n- `make test` ⚠️ blocked before project tests run on this host: `Tests/IMsgCoreTests/BridgeHelperLocatorTests.swift:2:8: error: no such module 'Testing'`\n- CI repair note: previous macOS CI failed because `BridgeCommandRegistrationTests.bridgeAttachmentStagingUsesChatGuid` still asserted the old `prepareOutgoingTransfer(..., chatGuid, &prepErr)` helper signature; `885e5a4` updates that source-level assertion to the current rich-link helper signature and normal-attachment call shape\n\n",
        "branch": "feat/rich-links",
